While we are in a reading of cards, endless combinations of tarot cards can come out, which can be to the right or turned upside down and that can come out in a particular order, learning to understand the interpretations that they can have at times can be very complicated, we need to study and know each of the cards.
An important point to understand is that we can know the meaning of a card individually, but if it comes out together with others, that interpretation may change and those points that must be taken into consideration.
We ask the following question: What is in store for me in my relationship as a couple?
After this the letters come out Moon, The Tower and Death, a correct interpretation of this hand, would be that your relationship is flooded by criticism or some inconveniences, which are changing the harmony and happiness that inhabited it, and could destroy it completely.
We ask the following question: What will my destiny be in my projects?
If instead of this the letters of Death and Lovers come out, it can be interpreted that certain barriers or economic difficulties are going to appear and they are due to the fact that you have not made the decisions with enough firmness to carry them out.
We ask the following question: What is my destiny in my work?
On the other hand, if the combination of: El Juicio, El Enamorado y La Torre comes out, it may indicate that even if the changes occur, they will not be economically good, they will not be encouraged to take the step, because what it offers your current job is much better.
In many letter reading sessions, one of the most recurrent questions is to ask for a consultation about starting a new business or project, based on this question we are going to present you with two possible combinations of letters that can be interpreted differently.
On the other hand, if they go out The star, The hermit and La Torre: This does not bring good news, although you have believed for a long time that your idea is very good and that it will generate great economic income, this is not the best time to start, many obstacles are visualized around you that will not allow a successful start and continue.
Do not forget to continue studying and reading so that you can get to have the correct interpretations and that way you can begin to know what destiny holds for you and yours. If all this information is not clear enough, we leave you a video below that we hope you enjoy.
