Later these same tarot cards were used to spread the message and story of Christ. The latter is what is counted under the Romans, but the real history of the tarot is another.
Mainly the creation was not for the purpose of using them as fortune tellingIn the beginning, these letters were created so that the wealthiest families of that time could use them for fun in special celebrations. In the beginning if you wanted to acquire those decks of cards so exclusive, They were called "Triumphs", But later they were changing the name to"Tarocchi","Taroc /k ","Tarau"And"Tarot".
No one really knows for sure when the use of tarot cards in the world of divination and clairvoyance, but already in the XV century New picture cards were developed to add to the famous deck of cards. They used the gods, philosophical ideas, astronomical and heroes to design them.
In addition, the tarot is not always linked and united as a divination tool, they also have other uses with the symbology or psychoanalysis. The tarot story is great and we could write an entire book to be able to perfectly develop the history, the origin, its creation and all the uses that we can give to the tarot cards.
La Tarot card of the Force represents nature, which, however wild it may be in its primitive form, is domesticated by our finest and finest being, our feminine side, our inner being. The will and passion of our instinctive nature need not be broken, but refined and brought into consciousness, so that all levels of creation can come into harmony.
