Multiplication table (times): benefits of studying Discover Online ▷
Professor Rômulo Mussel, graduated in Mathematics from UERJ, has a master's degree in Mathematics from IMPA and a professor at the Municipality of Rio de Janeiro, maintains a specialized blog. He decided to create the virtual space to help students "evolve their studies through the understanding of simple situations, but which need great reasoning power."
The student teacher deepens when he states that Knowing the times table is also essential to know how to divide: “Due to the experience I have in the classroom, the students start to have problems when the famous times and the divided bills appear, and this problem is only aggravated because the students do not know the multiplication table and when they do not know it. , any simple account becomes so laborious that the student ends up giving up ”.
According to the European, the multiplication table accelerates the student's reasoning, which learns the correct answers, without wasting time trying to formulate more open accounts. This is an important strategy for those who have little time to take an exam, such as Enem or other tests.
