13 mood verses: For difficult times
All living beings are prone to spend moments of difficulty, whether due to illness, family problems or any other situation that may arise. In those moments we can count on some mood verses for difficult times that have been written in the sacred scriptures so that we appropriate them in the midst of those moments of deep difficulty.
There are texts in this sacred book that seem to be written especially for us, we just have to get ready to look for them and they, guided by the same Holy Spirit of God, will reach us and they will give our soul the comfort, strength and everything that we need to be able to face our situation and we can move forward. Here are some biblical texts or verses of encouragement so you can read in difficult times.
Prove you're strong
We must trust that the good God has given us the way out of this difficulty we may be going through. He knows our hearts and in the midst of difficult times we can often lose sight and not be able to recognize the exit even if we have it in front of our eyes, that is the moment in which we must trust God and receive a little of his peace to that we can notice that escape route that he provides us.
He made you and established you. ”
We must think that just as these men of God achieved victory, we will also achieve it. They were imperfect and went through difficult situations but they were filled with God and thus they were able to recover, faith can help us to have peace even when we are going through a great storm.
Faith is what leads us to believe that he is ready to listen all our prayers, especially those that we do in the middle of moments of difficulty. God hears us and fills us with his strength so that we may have courage and not faint in the midst of difficulty.
This is a clear invitation to strengthen ourselves in the Lord, this must be our priority in the midst of difficulties and at all times. Keep in mind that God is our strength provider at the time we need it.
Believe in the powers of God
We can be sure that God is powerful, even for those things that we think there is no solution. He promises us that just as he is powerful in creating all things, he will be much more able to answer what we ask even beyond whether we understand it or not.
” This is a text that speaks of our future, it tells us that although we are having a bad time and our enemies rejoice in our problems, God will always become our strength to rise, in our light that in the midst of darkness, follows us lighting the way so we don't stumble.
The man asks us to keep all his teachings and then assures us that he will be our company until the end of the world. In those moments that pray that we lose strength, courage and even faith, remember that he is always with us.
Win love to others
We must remember that Jesus himself roasted on this earth and suffered in our own flesh all our ailments, he understands us in the midst of what we may be going through and takes pity on us. Let's stay close to him and enjoy his care and permanent love in our lives.
