Learn about the usefulness of fractions in everyday life. Discover Online ▷
Pizza with friends
To see how many fractions there are in people's lives, pay attention to a few examples:
A simple trip to the pizzeria with friends can represent a real math class, where the topic is fractions. Doubt?
As for the percentage, it is also a form of fraction. If the same recipe asks you to add 3/4 of a tablespoon of flour, that's 75% of the total.
The monetary system is another way to use the mathematical fraction. If you consider the amount of R $ 10, for example, as a representation of a whole, R $ 1 will be one-tenth of the value.
