Prayer to the Virgin of Fatima. Miraculous and Powerful!
Prayer to the Virgin of Fatima; In any need you have you can raise this prayer.
She, as the mother of our Lord Jesus Christ and friend of God, the creator of all things, can plead for us in heaven and thus obtain the favor or miracle that we so need.
The important thing is to do it with faith sure that she is listening to us and that our call for help will help.
Prayer to the Virgin of Fatima Who is the Virgin of Fatima?
What is the prayer of the Virgin of Fatima for?
Will this virgin help me?
It is said that in 1917, the virgin was seen by Francisco, Lucia and Jacinta who are known as the three shepherds of the Virgin of Fatima.
Other interesting details of the story tell that an angel known as Angel de Portugal, communicated with the little shepherds a year before with the intention of preparing them for the appearance of this virgin.
Prayer to the Virgin of Fatima
Trusting in your love, I ask you to give me of your Son Jesus a living faith, intelligence to know and love him, patience and grace to serve Him to my brothers, and one day to be able to unite with You there in Heaven.
My Mother, I also ask you for my parents, so that they may live together in love; for my brothers, family and friends, so that living together in family one day we can enjoy with you in eternal life.
I ask you in a special way for the conversion of sinners and the peace of the world; for the children, so that they never lack divine help and what is necessary for their bodies, and one day achieve eternal life.
Oh sweet Heart of Mary, be my salvation!
Holy writings, the heavenly father promises to answer all our prayers whenever they are done with faith and from the heart, that is, with sincerity.
Besides all this, there is the fact that this Virgin is presented to three children and from there to people who, like us, had needs and were in need of divine intervention in their lives.
Then we can say that, like all prayers, this one can also help at some point we need it.
The answer may take a long time to arrive, because zeal knows when to bless us, the important thing is not to lose faith and be sure that this prayer also fills us with peace in the midst of the storm we are experiencing and can make us understand many things that We didn't understand before.
Prayers can be done in any way, although novenaries can always be organized, prayers in families or special prayer time purposes.
At this point there are those who at some time do not have the knowledge to make a special prayer, in this case you can make a simple, sincere prayer with faith at any time and place.
She as a good mother guides us her children and grants those requests that we have in our hearts.
He has faith in the Miraculous prayer to the Virgin of Fatima.
