Their adventurous spirit makes them look for partners with whom they feel safe and who are not wasting time, for that they prefer to stay alone, so very aware of this, it can be a key point to maintain a relationship with an Aquarius.
We are mixing water with air, which results in a low compatibility, they are people with totally different personalities, each one has a very particular way of saying and doing things, which can generate lawsuits and arguments between them.
