They complement each other both intellectually and sentimentally, these two signs can form a very focused, stable couple and full of projects to fulfill, Gemini is for Aquarius that boy or girl with whom to project for a lifetime, they enjoy company and conversations a lot with the other. They are the representation of happily ever after.
