Smart Medical>CTMR remote monitoring
Large medical equipment CT, Mr, need to constantly monitor the running state of the system, as well as the environment temperature and humidity, parts loss, in order to facilitate routine maintenance and warranty.
The 4G router zr2000, CT / MR and other medical equipment are connected to the hospital LAN through the local IP address assigned by the hospital, and sent to the medical equipment maintenance system through the IPSec VPN Security tunnel established by the 4G router zr2000. The data is transmitted through the IPSec VPN channel based on the digital certificate, and the 4G router zr2000 ensures the security of the data to a great extent.
The maintenance personnel can monitor the temperature and humidity of CT / MR and the degree of spherical tank loss in real time through the 4G router zr2000, so as to update the maintenance in time. With virtual IP mapping, different IP of different hospitals can be managed in a unified way.
