Learning Center>What are the factors that affect the network speed of industrial 4G routers?
The 4G routers of ChilinkIOT are developed by engineers in the communications industry for more than 10 years. After continuous optimization and debugging, they also need to go through a long-term aging test.
The location of the 4G router is wrong.
Since the signal relies on electric waves to propagate, if it is interfered by other electromagnetic waves during transmission, it will also interfere with the signal of the 4G router. Although the 4G routers of ChilinkIOT have made anti-interference design, it is still recommended to stay away from strong interference sources when using them.
4G router WiFi channel is crowded Nowadays, there are many WiFi devices.
