The three-layer structure of the application of the Internet of Things: perception layer, network layer and application layer. The sensing layer collects the real-time status data of the lower air compressor unit, and the 4G router wirelessly transmits it to the application layer through the network layer.
The management center accesses the data collected in the cloud through the computer monitoring software interface, and issues control instructions to the air compressor unit. If there is no user command, it automatically controls the operation of the air compressor according to the load pressure.
