According to statistics, the current rural water pollutant discharge in my country accounts for more than 50% of the national water pollutant discharge, and the sewage treatment rate is between 10%-20%. A large amount of sewage is directly discharged without treatment, which seriously affects the safety of local drinking water.
Rural domestic sewage is generally domestic washing water, kitchen water or toilet flushing water. The discharge of rural domestic sewage is completely different from that of urban domestic water, because rural houses are relatively scattered, and the discharge of sewage is also scattered, and the scope is relatively wide.
Wetland domestic sewage treatment system: The wetland domestic sewage treatment system is generally divided into natural wetlands and constructed wetlands. The constructed wetland domestic sewage treatment system puts the sewage into the place where there are swamp plants, and absorbs the elements in the sewage through the plant roots and microorganisms, and purifies the sewage in this way.
However, in practical applications, it is usually troubled by the cost of construction and operation. As a result, the vast rural environment in my country still adopts the extensive method of waste water treatment, which has not brought good improvement to the rural environment for a long time.
The discharge of rural water pollutants remains high, accounting for more than 50% of the national water pollutant discharge, and because rural domestic sewage is far away from the urban pipeline network, the cost of collecting sewage pipelines is low, and the treatment rate is low due to the impact of funds. At present, it is mainly adopted Distributed sewage treatment plant treatment.
With the implementation of a series of new environmental protection policies in 2018, the water quality monitoring industry will usher in the normalization of supervision, the standardization of the market, and the deepening of governance. The rural sewage treatment market will be further released, opening up more market space for water quality monitoring companies.
