Passive Houses and Passive Buildings use very little energy and provide superior comfort by incorporating very tight air barriers, superinsulation, high performance glazing, heat recovery ventilation, and other features. CET can help you determine if Passive House certification is a realistic target for your project and then help you navigate the certification process from start to finish.
