LEED for Homes and LEED for Multifamily ratings systems score the environmental sustainability features of residential buildings, including location, water efficiency, energy performance, use of materials, and indoor environmental quality. CET can help you identify credits that are a good fit for your project goals to achieve LEED Silver, Gold, or Platinum.
