Small changes made by individuals can make a huge difference and inspire others to do the same. Here are some of our favorite tips to help you green your office!
Instead of printing reports or notes, email them or upload them to the cloud so everyone can access them. If you don’t have to print them, then don’t!
LED light bulbs are becoming the norm, so make the switch!
