Electric mobile racking system is a high-density system for optimizing the space in the warehouse, where the racks are put on mobile chassis guided through tracks on the floor, although the advanced configuration can work without tracks.
The chassis is equipped with motor enabling the racks to move along the tracks, leaving the opening for the forklift to access. Opening of only one aisle is required instead of many aisles for forklift to go through as in traditional selective racking system.
The electric mobile racking system is equipped with PLC to execute commands from the remote control by the operator, smart functions like increasing the opening gap between chassis for better air circulation could be done through PLC programming, such functions make it a semi-automated racking system.
The electric mobile racking system is ideal for users who want to expand storage but are limited by the floor space in the warehouse. The maximumly used floor space render the mobile racking system a perfect choice for cold storage.
